      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Logging for the structured logging service, and now the next step is to make this clear within the `write_structured_log.py` file. I'm focusing on how best to integrate the Google Cloud Logging library into the script and make its usage explicit.\n\n\n**Implementing Cloud Logging**\n\nNow, I'm concretely implementing Google Cloud Logging within the script. The `write_structured_log.py` file is coming together with the necessary imports and client initialization. The emphasis is on explicit provider identification via the Google Cloud Logging library. The primary goal remains to write that structured JSON log event.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820924466,
          "start": 1789820922279
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
